# To-Do List for emoji.today

## Architecture & Database Design

### Database Tables (Supabase)
- [ ] **users** table
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - farcaster_id (unique)
  - wallet_address
  - created_at
  - updated_at

- [ ] **votes** table
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - user_id (foreign key to users)
  - emoji (string)
  - vote_date (date)
  - transaction_hash
  - created_at
  - UNIQUE constraint on (user_id, vote_date)

- [ ] **daily_results** table
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - vote_date (date, unique)
  - winning_emoji
  - total_votes
  - total_pot_amount
  - nft_mint_transaction_hash
  - auction_contract_address
  - winner_wallet_address (raffle winner)
  - created_at

- [ ] **participation_streaks** table
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - user_id (foreign key to users)
  - current_streak (integer)
  - longest_streak (integer)
  - last_vote_date (date)
  - updated_at

- [ ] **shares** table (to track sharing for bonus odds)
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - user_id (foreign key to users)
  - vote_id (foreign key to votes)
  - platform (enum: 'farcaster', 'twitter')
  - share_url
  - created_at

